    {
      "id": "aldesleukin-ar",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Aldesleukin (high-dose IL-2) (ar)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "aldesleukin",
      "language": "ar",
      "available": true,
      "text": "كان interleukin-2 بجرعة عالية أول علاج مناعي يشفي جزءاً صغيراً من مرضى الميلانوما النقيلية وسرطان الكلى، على حساب سمية بمستوى العناية المركزة؛ واليوم يدعم أساساً علاج TIL.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "b7cb5fcf80fd6eb593462a802b68b27c0f6a5c6a3d96dde8208eb1561886bdec",
      "renderSha256": "350f77ffb3ea2919c4ba99b78a154afea1fc24f3f4d7c22ebf27b9fd7244244b"
    },
    {
      "id": "aldesleukin-de",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Aldesleukin (high-dose IL-2) (de)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "aldesleukin",
      "language": "de",
      "available": true,
      "text": "Hochdosiertes Interleukin-2 war die erste Immuntherapie, die einen kleinen Teil der Patienten mit metastasiertem Melanom und Nierenkrebs heilte, um den Preis einer Toxizität auf Intensivstationsniveau; heute dient es hauptsächlich zur Unterstützung der TIL-Therapie.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "2230342df09d939a93559e8e2e46c7ba2e4b361f7e01c0d32d2efd51d7f10921",
      "renderSha256": "c16895cd04bd41864e78281de2d547f45904f04eb3af5d94a60f5262e12e7170"
    },
    {
      "id": "aldesleukin-es",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Aldesleukin (high-dose IL-2) (es)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "aldesleukin",
      "language": "es",
      "available": true,
      "text": "La interleucina-2 en dosis altas fue la primera inmunoterapia que curó a una pequeña fracción de pacientes con melanoma metastásico y cáncer de riñón, a costa de una toxicidad de nivel de UCI; hoy sirve sobre todo de apoyo a la terapia con TIL.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "cae14aa5f5406d6c29d0b500c35f2ba06d6b69fe2dc29ad286c8b9726d6dc2c1",
      "renderSha256": "724fcf87a696c949ab3a57dd2645308a12dfa75d3f38304413324d0ae11f0c5b"
    },
    {
      "id": "aldesleukin-fr",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Aldesleukin (high-dose IL-2) (fr)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "aldesleukin",
      "language": "fr",
      "available": true,
      "text": "L'interleukine-2 à haute dose a été la première immunothérapie à guérir une petite fraction des patients atteints de mélanome métastatique et de cancer du rein, au prix d'une toxicité de niveau réanimation ; aujourd'hui elle sert surtout de soutien à la thérapie par TIL.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "1f1dd1063952a55320769db3b6f15a8a33bf19c1f552e95c546e35036ea85d50",
      "renderSha256": "f60444d054fb33d756e156a0f917328e9c52db5abcbab3930877ef965f068ebb"
    },
    {
      "id": "aldesleukin-hi",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Aldesleukin (high-dose IL-2) (hi)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "aldesleukin",
      "language": "hi",
      "available": true,
      "text": "उच्च-खुराक interleukin-2 पहली इम्यूनोथेरेपी थी जिसने मेटास्टेटिक मेलेनोमा और किडनी कैंसर के मरीजों के एक छोटे हिस्से को ठीक किया, हालांकि ICU-स्तर की विषाक्तता की कीमत पर; आज यह मुख्य रूप से TIL थेरेपी को सहारा देती है।",
      "selectedTextSha256": "a186bd702de26a223989053d9c3f1769b26fb0879d3d36eb9944ae2f27196e76",
      "renderSha256": "a0404e4bf14a24880182e553894fa6f0413c45581772a5de940b77fa5aabcd08"
    },
    {
      "id": "aldesleukin-ja",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Aldesleukin (high-dose IL-2) (ja)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "aldesleukin",
      "language": "ja",
      "available": true,
      "text": "高用量interleukin-2は、転移性メラノーマと腎がんの患者のごく一部を治癒させた最初の免疫療法であるが、その代償はICUレベルの毒性であった。今日では主にTIL療法を支える役割を担う。",
      "selectedTextSha256": "c769546f871241f8d3243003c5b074f75befefddc984120d2aa813701ca3fb4a",
      "renderSha256": "a19f133e8f6862b99b7f3f1e4e7efcda25c4cf81395ee1a5bd1698416250ecd2"
    },
    {
      "id": "aldesleukin-pt",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Aldesleukin (high-dose IL-2) (pt)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "aldesleukin",
      "language": "pt",
      "available": true,
      "text": "A interleucina-2 em altas doses foi a primeira imunoterapia a curar uma pequena fração dos pacientes com melanoma metastático e câncer de rim, ao custo de uma toxicidade de nível de UTI; hoje ela serve principalmente de apoio à terapia com TIL.",
      "selectedTextSha256": "4da6d34687e03a4b813d3ecf10c75bd938b14562ef58a2b37b3548d6183f129c",
      "renderSha256": "d421ca99fd2f5c7bbb47ac309f3fb39ff636db7ae307c134686062cb7dc19ecc"
    },
    {
      "id": "aldesleukin-zh",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Aldesleukin (high-dose IL-2) (zh)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "aldesleukin",
      "language": "zh",
      "available": true,
      "text": "高剂量interleukin-2是首个能治愈一小部分转移性黑色素瘤和肾癌患者的免疫疗法，代价是ICU级别的毒性；如今它主要用于支持TIL疗法。",
      "selectedTextSha256": "99db5028852a7f05b587dab805f6480c8d4270f3e5904032069d38c1665b9f68",
      "renderSha256": "e950182abed3416178108102143e2ecb39fc3952b2c90faf3e1e906fa171b2d1"
    },
    {
      "id": "aldesleukin-simple",
      "kind": "reader-summary-entry",
      "name": "Aldesleukin (high-dose IL-2) (simple)",
      "canonicalRecordId": "aldesleukin",
      "language": "simple",
      "available": true,
      "text": "High-dose interleukin-2 was the first immunotherapy to cure a small fraction of patients with spread melanoma and kidney cancer, at the cost of intensive-care-level toxicity.",
